### Variables: inject a permanent Supabase JWT locally; never commit tokens.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = {{$dotenv CLOUDBREAK_JWT}}

### Permanent account: get-or-create (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Repeat: same profile and same supabase_user_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current account and survey state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Survey persistence: first answer (use a fresh permanent account)
# Expected: 200, survey_completed_at set, app_store / hiker / false returned.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "app_store",
  "practice": "hiker",
  "newsletter_opt_in": false,
  "skipped": false
}

### Survey persistence: second answer is ignored (terminal state)
# Expected: 200 with the exact values and survey_completed_at from the first request.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acquisition_source": "instagram",
  "practice": "photographer",
  "newsletter_opt_in": true,
  "skipped": false
}

### Survey persistence: read the terminal state
# Expected: the survey_completed_at from the first request and survey_skipped_at null.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Or skip it (terminal and idempotent)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skipped": true}

### Newsletter consent — withdraw (RGPD, always mutable, unlike the survey)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"newsletter_opt_in": false}

### Newsletter consent — grant again
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"newsletter_opt_in": true}

### Preferences without Authorization: expected 403
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{"newsletter_opt_in": false}

### Preferences with unknown field: expected 422
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"unexpected": true}

### Anonymous JWT: expected 403 ACCOUNT_REQUIRED
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/provision
# Authorization: Bearer <anonymous-jwt>

### Delete account (RGPD: local users/data first, then auth.users)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dev only: reset the survey (404 when ENVIRONMENT=production)
# Expected: 200, survey_completed_at and survey_skipped_at null. Then PATCH /survey is accepted again.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset without Authorization
# Expected: 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/survey/reset
